      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.16,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "So in the previous course lecture",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 5.64,
          "en": "I provided some components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.64,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "but we haven't taken a closer look at them yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "That's what we'll do now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "At the moment, we're not using any of these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "but we're going to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 17.01,
          "en": "But let's first of all see what we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 17.01,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "We have, for example, the AuthForm component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "in the auth folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 23.1,
          "en": "This simply renders a form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 23.1,
          "end": 25.38,
          "en": "which we'll use on the auth page in the future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 25.38,
          "end": 28.65,
          "en": "a form that asks users for an email and a password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 28.65,
          "end": 30.24,
          "en": "and which can be submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.24,
          "end": 32.31,
          "en": "Now this form will still need some tweaking",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 32.31,
          "end": 34.05,
          "en": "but it's generally finished",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 34.05,
          "end": 38.85,
          "en": "and we can therefore use it in this auth.jsx file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 38.85,
          "end": 43.05,
          "en": "In there, we can import this AuthForm",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 43.05,
          "end": 48.05,
          "en": "from ~/components/auth/AuthForm.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 53.84,
          "en": "And for .js and .jsx files, you can omit the file extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.78,
          "end": 59.313,
          "en": "And then here we can simply return AuthForm like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 63.27,
          "en": "Now, you might get an error now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 63.27,
          "end": 66,
          "en": "if you try to build this and visit this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66,
          "end": 68.55,
          "en": "You might get an error that Remix could not resolve,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.55,
          "end": 71.7,
          "en": "react-icons/fa.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.7,
          "end": 75.84,
          "en": "And as a result, if you try to visit the Auth Page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.84,
          "end": 77.7,
          "en": "you don't really see it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.7,
          "end": 82.14,
          "en": "because the project wasn't rebuilt successfully by Remix,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.14,
          "end": 84.57300000000001,
          "en": "those changes weren't picked up successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.56,
          "end": 88.5,
          "en": "Now this is happening because in this AuthForum",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 88.5,
          "end": 90.36,
          "en": "and also in a couple of other components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 90.36,
          "end": 93.09,
          "en": "I'm using an extra third-party library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.09,
          "end": 95.16,
          "en": "that provides some icons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.16,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "We simply need to install that library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.25999999999999,
          "end": 100.053,
          "en": "to make this component and some other components work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "Installing it is super simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 104.72999999999999,
          "en": "In your terminal, in this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 104.72999999999999,
          "end": 109.72999999999999,
          "en": "you simply run npm install react-icons, and that's it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 109.8,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "Simply hit Enter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 112.41,
          "en": "This will install a package.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.41,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "And once you did that, you can run npm run dev again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 118.44,
          "en": "restart the dev server and now everything will work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.44,
          "end": 120.87,
          "en": "and you will see that auth form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 120.87,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "Again, it's not functional yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 124.923,
          "en": "but it looks quite decent, I'd argue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 126.15,
          "end": 128.04,
          "en": "So that is the first component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 128.04,
          "end": 129.123,
          "en": "What else do we have?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 130.44,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "Well, besides this AuthForm component, which we included,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 136.41,
          "en": "we also get a bunch of expenses-related components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.41,
          "end": 139.71,
          "en": "For example, components that help us display some chart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.71,
          "end": 141.84,
          "en": "and the bars of that chart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 141.84,
          "end": 144.27,
          "en": "and then also the statistics component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 144.27,
          "end": 146.28,
          "en": "Now, definitely feel free to read",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 146.28,
          "end": 148.59,
          "en": "through the code of these components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 148.59,
          "end": 150.21,
          "en": "by simply pausing the video",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 150.21,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "and then taking a look at what's in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.21,
          "en": "There's nothing Remix specific in these components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 156.21,
          "end": 158.52,
          "en": "It's all just standard React code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 158.52,
          "end": 160.35,
          "en": "and therefore I'm currently not spending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 160.35,
          "end": 162.78,
          "en": "too much time on that and we're not building this together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 162.78,
          "end": 165.06,
          "en": "but you can absolutely explore this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 165.06,
          "end": 168.15,
          "en": "to see how I build those components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.15,
          "end": 171.06,
          "en": "Also, feel free to tweak them or play around with them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 171.06,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "but keep in mind that this could break some styles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 177.09300000000002,
          "en": "especially if you change structures or class names.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 177.96,
          "end": 181.08,
          "en": "Now besides Chart, ChartBar and ExpenseStatistics,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 181.08,
          "end": 184.8,
          "en": "we also have a form that allows us to enter new expense data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "or which will later all be used for editing expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 188.46,
          "end": 190.47,
          "en": "And we get the expenses list component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 190.47,
          "end": 192.87,
          "en": "that will soon render a list of expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 192.87,
          "end": 195.3,
          "en": "and the expense list item component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 195.3,
          "end": 196.86,
          "en": "that renders these single items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 196.86,
          "end": 200.07,
          "en": "in that list of expenses here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 200.07,
          "end": 202.933,
          "en": "because we of course wanna display such a list of expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 202.933,
          "end": 206.133,
          "en": "where we can see them all, edit them and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 207.09,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "Now let's use some of these expense components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 215.39,
          "en": "and let's maybe start with the analysis-related ones.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.57999999999998,
          "end": 217.95,
          "en": "In the analysis.jsx file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 217.95,
          "end": 221.68,
          "en": "we can simply import ExpenseStatistics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.46,
          "end": 229.46,
          "en": "from ~/components/expenses/ExpenseStatistics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 229.53,
          "end": 232.74,
          "en": "and import the Chart component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 232.74,
          "end": 235.263,
          "en": "from ~/components/expenses/Chart.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 236.57999999999998,
          "end": 240.12,
          "en": "And then in here we can return a main element",
