        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 242.67,
          "end": 245.373,
          "en": "and below that, the ExpenseStatistics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 246.81,
          "end": 250.2,
          "en": "Now both the Chart and the ExpenseStatistics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 250.2,
          "end": 251.643,
          "en": "need expenses to work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.51,
          "end": 254.97,
          "en": "And at the moment we have no expenses data yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 256.95,
          "en": "because we're going to dive into data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 256.95,
          "end": 258.93,
          "en": "data manipulation, data fetching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 258.93,
          "end": 262.383,
          "en": "and working with a database in the next course section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.52,
          "end": 264.57,
          "en": "Therefore, for the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 264.57,
          "end": 267.93,
          "en": "I'll just add some dummy expenses here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 267.93,
          "end": 269.25,
          "en": "which we can use in the meantime",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 269.25,
          "end": 271.86,
          "en": "so that we have something to see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 271.86,
          "end": 274.86,
          "en": "And every expense should simply have an ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 274.86,
          "end": 278.7,
          "en": "a title like First Expense,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 278.7,
          "end": 283.23,
          "en": "then also an amount which should be a number like 12.99",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 283.23,
          "end": 286.06,
          "en": "and a date, and here I'll just use new Date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 287.07,
          "end": 289.95,
          "en": "and then actually convert it to a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 289.95,
          "end": 293.31,
          "en": "so that we have today's date here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.31,
          "end": 296.64,
          "en": "This is just a dummy expense and one would be enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 296.64,
          "end": 299.90999999999997,
          "en": "We can also add a second one if you want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 299.90999999999997,
          "end": 304.59,
          "en": "second expense with a different name and ID and amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 304.59,
          "end": 308.52,
          "en": "And those dummy expenses can be passed to those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 308.52,
          "end": 312.63,
          "en": "to Chart and ExpensesStatistics by adding the expenses props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 312.63,
          "end": 316.65,
          "en": "and passing the dummy expenses here as values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 316.65,
          "end": 318.57,
          "en": "So we'll do that for the Chart",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 318.57,
          "end": 321.033,
          "en": "and also for the ExpenseStatistics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 322.23,
          "end": 325.53,
          "en": "And if we do that, if we set up those expenses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 325.53,
          "end": 327.66,
          "en": "and pass them to these two components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 327.66,
          "end": 332.58,
          "en": "then we should be able to visit /expenses/analysis",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 332.58,
          "end": 336.45,
          "en": "and see the dummy chart and these statistics.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 336.45,
          "end": 338.61,
          "en": "If you're getting an error, simply make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 338.61,
          "end": 341.13,
          "en": "that you did set up those dummy expenses correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 341.13,
          "end": 342.63,
          "en": "or use the code attachments,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 342.63,
          "end": 345.63,
          "en": "which I provide more on that in the first core section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 345.63,
          "end": 348.21,
          "en": "to compare your code to mine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 348.21,
          "end": 350.58,
          "en": "So that's the analysis part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 350.58,
          "end": 354.72,
          "en": "Now for the form, we can go to the add route here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 354.72,
          "end": 357.45,
          "en": "because that is where I do wanna show this form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 357.45,
          "end": 359.90999999999997,
          "en": "And therefore in here, I'll simply import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 359.90999999999997,
          "end": 362.94,
          "en": "the ExpensesForm like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 362.94,
          "end": 367.11,
          "en": "and then here we can output ExpenseForm like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 367.11,
          "end": 369.54,
          "en": "And for the moment, this is get all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 369.54,
          "end": 373.2,
          "en": "We can, by the way do the same thing and copy this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 373.2,
          "end": 376.71,
          "en": "on the $id route, expenses/$id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 376.71,
          "end": 380.07,
          "en": "because there later we'll be able to edit an expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 380.07,
          "end": 381.75,
          "en": "and I wanna show the form for that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 381.75,
          "end": 385.44,
          "en": "and therefore we can already import that form and display it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 385.44,
          "end": 388.11,
          "en": "even though at the moment editing and so on, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
