          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 393.06,
          "end": 395.97,
          "en": "Nonetheless, we can import and display it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 395.97,
          "end": 400.26,
          "en": "And now if we go to expenses/add, we see that form",
          "zh": ""
